# smoke-multi.list — smoke scenarios that need more than one screen.
#
# Added to the nested smoke (`ADRT_SMOKE=1`) only when the run is configured with
# more than one virtual monitor (`ADRT_MONITORS='1280x800:1280x800'`, the monitor
# matrix). Entries self-skip when the harness screen count is not the one they
# need, so this is safe to include only when it applies. Same rules as
# smoke.list: one id per line, `#` comments, and an entry with no scenario file
# aborts the run by name.
#
#   per-screen axis (each screen tiles on its own)   A105-per-screen-axis
#   a newcomer pairs on its own screen, not the       A157-per-screen-slots
#     other screen's slots
#   a window on a second screen is not exiled        A106-no-cross-monitor-exile
#   cross-screen drag takes the free slot / swaps    A107-cross-monitor-drag-takes-the-free-slot-or-swaps
#   a maximised drag stays maximised at the drop     A108-maximised-drag-still-maximised-at-drop
#   disconnect rescues the layout                    A109-disconnect-routes
#   reconnect replays the remembered state           A110-reconnect-replays-state
#   reconnect restores a float exactly               A143-reconnect-restores-float
#   a primary change keeps slots, extras float       A111-primary-change-keeps-slots-and-the-extra-window-floats
#   rescue side and order                            A122-rescue-side-and-order
#   the arriving window takes its side from the      A124-screen-side-rule
#     monitor signal
#   the four-monitor matrix                          A81-four-monitors
#   every configured screen (1 to 4), any arrangement, keeps its own axis and
#   contains its windows, gated by topology signature          #   the same, gated by an exact declared signature so it can be driven

A105-per-screen-axis
A106-no-cross-monitor-exile
A157-per-screen-slots
A107-cross-monitor-drag-takes-the-free-slot-or-swaps
A108-maximised-drag-still-maximised-at-drop
A109-disconnect-routes
A110-reconnect-replays-state
A143-reconnect-restores-float
A111-primary-change-keeps-slots-and-the-extra-window-floats
A122-rescue-side-and-order
A145-float-restore-exact
A124-screen-side-rule
A81-four-monitors
